 Release notes are listed newest first. English is followed by Simplified Chinese.
 Test releases are experimental and do not establish real-vehicle compatibility.
 
+## [v0.1.27-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R40 — media-aware projected shell candidate; real-vehicle validation pending.
+
+### English
+- Apply a bounded album-art accent to the music wallpaper, preserving sharp text and navigation video.
+- Disable unsupported media controls and skip them in rotary focus; recheck the actual player capability before dispatch.
+- Hide revoked media data and describe source inactivity without asserting a network failure.
+- Extrapolate progress from the provider monotonic timestamp rather than the polling clock.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 音乐界面从真实专辑封面提取受限背景色，不改变地图及文字像素。
+- 不支持的媒体按钮置灰并跳过旋钮焦点，执行前重新检查真实播放器能力。
+- 权限失效后隐藏媒体数据，源画面静止不误报断网。
+- 按播放器真实单调时钟锚点推算进度，避免轮询导致回跳。
+
 ## [v0.1.26-test.1] - 2026-11-25
 
 > R39 — projection input generation and playback presentation candidate.
